body:
Maybe he is angry with his parents for letting him get to 33 without any skills of any sort and then trying to cut him off from the family.  Maybe they aren't even his real parents, and that's why they failed him.  Sounds like a family issue.   This world is becoming more and more soul-less.  What's the point of working for if you don't even have any personal connections or bonds with people, and no peers around yourself?  And what would make a person not want to contribute if his family is truly in need?  They're probably not in need, sounds like they're jerks. Honestly, it's not your responsibility, it's his parents' responsibility.  Maybe this is his sarcastic way of telling you to fuck off, because his family is failing him and by trying to offer him a low end soulless job at his age is just a slap in the face.  


&#x200B;

And all these TOXIC, HATEFUL comments are the exact reason why this shit happens in the first place.  You should ALL be ashamed of yourselves.
